# Routes (`app/**`)

- **Expo Router** file-based routing under `app/(site)/`.
- Dynamic segments:
  - `blog/posts/[slug].tsx` — magazine post slug / id
  - `podcast/interviews/[slug].tsx` — podcast entry id
  - `legal/[slug].tsx`, `authors/[slug].tsx`
- Use `generateStaticParams` on dynamic screens so static web export includes every entry.
- Site chrome lives in `app/(site)/_layout.tsx` (header, footer, theme).
- Prefer `PageSeo` on each screen for web document titles.
